00:17:10,450 --> 00:17:12,159
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'd know it anywhere.</font>

392
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:15,533
<font color="#FFFFFF">Many times I've woken up to that
ass hanging over <i>mein</i> bowl.</font>

393
00:17:15,575 --> 00:17:18,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wow, Klaus, I guess Roger's ass
is cuter than you.</font>

394
00:17:18,491 --> 00:17:19,394
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dick.</font>

395
00:17:19,409 --> 00:17:21,325
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, Dick Vermeil.</font>

396
00:17:21,367 --> 00:17:23,533
<font color="#FFFFFF">I won a ring
with the Rams.</font>

397
00:17:23,575 --> 00:17:25,575
<font color="#FFFFFF">Flipped it on you, bitch.</font>

398
00:17:25,616 --> 00:17:27,616
<font color="#FFFFFF">I flipped it on them.</font>

399
00:17:27,658 --> 00:17:30,367
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, they will go upstairs,
they will Google Dick Vermeil,</font>

400
00:17:30,409 --> 00:17:33,825
<font color="#FFFFFF">and they will know
how bad I nailed them.</font>

401
00:17:36,325 --> 00:17:38,242
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is the spot.
Now, where's Stan?</font>

402
00:17:38,284 --> 00:17:40,491
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's a note
in the pneumatic tube.</font>

403
00:17:42,075 --> 00:17:44,367
<font color="#FFFFFF">"Send in the key,
and Papa Wheelie is yours.</font>

404
00:17:44,409 --> 00:17:45,700
<font color="#FFFFFF">We are watching."</font>

405
00:17:45,741 --> 00:17:48,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">They can have the key.
We already have the bag.</font>

406
00:17:51,658 --> 00:17:54,033
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoa, that sucks really good.</font>

407
00:17:54,075 --> 00:17:58,575
<font color="#FFFFFF">You think anyone's ever…
done stuff with it?</font>

408
00:17:58,616 --> 00:18:01,575
<font color="#FFFFFF">Should I do
stuff with it?</font>

409
00:18:01,616 --> 00:18:04,409
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do we have time for me
to do stuff with it?</font>

410
00:18:04,450 --> 00:18:07,325
<font color="#FFFFFF">If I do stuff with it
and stuff goes wrong,</font>

411
00:18:07,367 --> 00:18:08,741
<font color="#FFFFFF">will you help me?</font>

412
00:18:08,783 --> 00:18:10,409
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, wait. There he is.</font>

413
00:18:10,450 --> 00:18:12,325
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad! We're coming
for you!</font>

414
00:18:12,367 --> 00:18:14,367
<font color="#FFFFFF">How do we get in there?
I have an idea.</font>

415
00:18:14,409 --> 00:18:16,616
<font color="#FFFFFF">Quick, grab my disguise
kit out of the trunk.</font>

416
00:18:22,491 --> 00:18:23,992
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad, what happened?</font>

417
00:18:24,033 --> 00:18:25,284
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's Bonkers.</font>

418
00:18:25,325 --> 00:18:27,200
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know, this whole thing
is just bananas.</font>

419
00:18:27,242 --> 00:18:29,409
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, it's Bonkers…
Teddy Bonkers.</font>

420
00:18:29,450 --> 00:18:31,200
<font color="#FFFFFF">He did this.
He's behind you.</font>

421
00:18:33,867 --> 00:18:35,783
<font color="#FFFFFF">He had it out for me
the whole time.</font>

422
00:18:35,825 --> 00:18:37,783
<font color="#FFFFFF">He gave me the wrong
coffee order for Roger.</font>

423
00:18:37,825 --> 00:18:39,575
<font color="#FFFFFF">He encouraged
my smart-mouth persona,</font>

424
00:18:39,616 --> 00:18:41,033
<font color="#FFFFFF">knowing full well it would bomb.</font>

425
00:18:41,075 --> 00:18:42,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bonkers wanted me fired,
and when that didn't happen,</font>

426
00:18:42,992 --> 00:18:44,033
<font color="#FFFFFF">he wanted me dead.</font>

427
00:18:44,075 --> 00:18:45,533
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

428
00:18:45,575 --> 00:18:46,867
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, my god.
Of course!</font>

429
00:18:46,908 --> 00:18:48,741
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bonkers was jealous
that you came in</font>

430
00:18:48,783 --> 00:18:49,908
<font color="#FFFFFF">as a junior detective</font>

431
00:18:49,950 --> 00:18:51,741
<font color="#FFFFFF">when he was next in line
for a promotion.</font>

432
00:18:51,783 --> 00:18:53,367
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Bonkers.</font>

433
00:18:53,409 --> 00:18:55,367
<font color="#FFFFFF">How could
you do this?</font>

434
00:18:56,908 --> 00:18:58,783
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, for the love
of god, Roger.</font>

435
00:18:58,825 --> 00:19:00,908
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bonkers is not real!</font>

436
00:19:00,950 --> 00:19:02,491
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?
What are you saying?</font>

437
00:19:02,533 --> 00:19:05,325
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bonkers is a stuffed
bear… a toy!</font>

438
00:19:05,367 --> 00:19:07,533
<font color="#FFFFFF">I didn't want to tell you,
but I hate this bit!</font>

439
00:19:07,575 --> 00:19:09,700
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here's why…
it's stupid!</font>

440
00:19:09,741 --> 00:19:11,533
<font color="#FFFFFF">A teddy bear
as our receptionist?</font>

441
00:19:11,575 --> 00:19:13,117
<font color="#FFFFFF">It doesn't even make sense.</font>

442
00:19:13,159 --> 00:19:15,033
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you know how many calls
we've missed?</font>

443
00:19:15,075 --> 00:19:16,575
<font color="#FFFFFF">But, Steve…</font>

444
00:19:16,616 --> 00:19:19,200
<font color="#FFFFFF">I went along with it 'cause
I didn't want to upset you.</font>

445
00:19:19,242 --> 00:19:20,824
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't stand
telling people</font>

446
00:19:20,825 --> 00:19:22,284
<font color="#FFFFFF">things they don't
want to hear, but…</font>

447
00:19:23,284 --> 00:19:24,575
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey.</font>

448
00:19:24,616 --> 00:19:26,325
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why, I did it.</font>

449
00:19:26,367 --> 00:19:28,325
<font color="#FFFFFF">I told someone bad news.</font>

450
00:19:28,367 --> 00:19:30,783
<font color="#FFFFFF">But if Bonkers
isn't real,</font>

451
00:19:30,825 --> 00:19:33,658
<font color="#FFFFFF">then who kidnapped
Papa Wheelie?</font>

452
00:19:35,159 --> 00:19:36,658
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was you.</font>

453
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:38,658
<font color="#FFFFFF">You framed Teddy Bonkers.</font>

454
00:19:38,700 --> 00:19:40,491
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's true.</font>

455
00:19:40,533 --> 00:19:42,117
<font color="#FFFFFF">I knew you wanted to fire me.</font>

456
00:19:42,159 --> 00:19:43,616
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, I knew.</font>

457
00:19:43,658 --> 00:19:45,741
<font color="#FFFFFF">So I figured,
if I made Bonkers the bad guy,</font>

458
00:19:45,783 --> 00:19:47,325
<font color="#FFFFFF">I could blame
all my mistakes on him</font>

459
00:19:47,367 --> 00:19:48,908
<font color="#FFFFFF">and you'd give me
another chance.</font>

460
00:19:48,950 --> 00:19:51,117
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I made one miscalculation.</font>

461
00:19:51,159 --> 00:19:54,075
<font color="#FFFFFF">I never thought Steve
would have the guts</font>

462
00:19:54,117 --> 00:19:55,908
<font color="#FFFFFF">to tell you Bonkers was fake.</font>

463
00:19:55,950 --> 00:19:57,825
<font color="#FFFFFF">The only thing
I don't get</font>

464
00:19:57,867 --> 00:19:59,700
<font color="#FFFFFF">is why you went
to all this trouble.</font>

465
00:19:59,741 --> 00:20:01,159
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was bored, Steve.</font>

466
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:02,741
<font color="#FFFFFF">Really, really bored.</font>

467
00:20:02,783 --> 00:20:04,159
<font color="#FFFFFF">Like, so bored.</font>

468
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:05,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">So, you cut off
your own finger?</font>

469
00:20:05,992 --> 00:20:07,491
<font color="#FFFFFF">That wasn't my finger.</font>

470
00:20:07,533 --> 00:20:10,033
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was a fish stick I sucked
the bread crumbs off of.</font>

471
00:20:10,075 --> 00:20:13,367
<font color="#FFFFFF">I thought there was something
fishy about all this, Legman.</font>

472
00:20:13,409 --> 00:20:15,783
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, I'm not playing
without Bonkers!</font>

473
00:20:17,325 --> 00:20:18,533
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know what?</font>

474
00:20:18,575 --> 00:20:21,908
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not so bad being
the "bear-er" of bad news.</font>

475
00:20:21,950 --> 00:20:25,491
<font color="#FFFFFF">Or the sharer
of new shoes.</font>

476
00:20:25,533 --> 00:20:26,908
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're fired.</font>

477
00:20:26,950 --> 00:20:29,325
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoo! That felt great!</font>

478
00:20:29,367 --> 00:20:31,200
<font color="#FFFFFF">I gotta keep this goin'!</font>

479
00:20:31,242 --> 00:20:33,908
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your bird is dead!</font>

480
00:20:33,950 --> 00:20:35,575
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your grandfather
was an idiot.</font>

481
00:20:35,616 --> 00:20:37,825
<font color="#FFFFFF">His legacy…
an empty satchel</font>

482
00:20:37,867 --> 00:20:40,367
<font color="#FFFFFF">that lights up
when you open it!</font>

483
00:20:40,409 --> 00:20:42,491
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're not cute!</font>

484
00:20:42,533 --> 00:20:44,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm telling you,
a girl's friends</font>

485
00:20:44,992 --> 00:20:47,367
<font color="#FFFFFF">get in her ear, it is over.</font>

486
00:20:47,409 --> 00:20:50,075
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're all, "Make him
take you to a restaurant.</font>

487
00:20:50,117 --> 00:20:52,409
<font color="#FFFFFF">Make him buy
you sandals."</font>

488
00:20:52,450 --> 00:20:53,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't care what
every single person</font>

489
00:20:53,992 --> 00:20:56,783
<font color="#FFFFFF">on Earth says…
you're hilarious.</font>

490
00:21:30,284 --> 00:21:32,200
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bye! Have a beautiful time.</font>

491
00:21:32,242 --> 00:21:33,242
<font color="#FFFFFF">Captioned by Point.360</font>

